msgstr "``LMCACHE_MP_COORDINATOR_TIMEOUT_KEEP_ALIVE``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:89
msgid ""
"Seconds the HTTP server keeps idle connections open before closing them. "
"Must be greater than the MP servers' heartbeat interval (default ``5``), "
"otherwise heartbeat requests may hit a closing connection and fail with "
"``Server disconnected without sending a response``."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 服务器在关闭空闲连接之前保持打开的秒数。必须大于 MP 服务器的心跳间隔（默认 "
"``5``），否则心跳请求可能会遇到关闭的连接并失败，出现 ``服务器在未发送响应的情况下断开连接``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:94
msgid "``LMCACHE_MP_COORDINATOR_ENABLE_STARTUP_RESYNC``"
msgstr "``LMCACHE_MP_COORDINATOR_ENABLE_STARTUP_RESYNC``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:95
msgid "``True``"
msgstr "``True``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:96
msgid ""
"When ``True``, the coordinator runs a one-shot L2 resync on startup that "
"paginates an MP server's ``GET /cache/objects`` and backfills usage + "
"eviction trackers from existing L2 contents. Disable to start from empty "
"trackers (handy for tests, or deployments that start the coordinator "
"before any MP server)."
msgstr ""
"当设置为 ``True`` 时，协调器在启动时会执行一次 L2 重新同步，分页 MP 服务器的 ``GET /cache/objects`` "
"并从现有的 L2 内容中填充使用情况和逐出跟踪器。禁用此选项可以从空跟踪器开始（适用于测试或在任何 MP 服务器之前启动协调器的部署）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:101
msgid "``LMCACHE_MP_COORDINATOR_RESYNC_POLL_INTERVAL``"
msgstr "``LMCACHE_MP_COORDINATOR_RESYNC_POLL_INTERVAL``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:103
msgid ""
"Seconds between registry checks while waiting for the first MP server to "
"register so startup resync can begin."
msgstr "在等待第一个 MP 服务器注册以便启动重新同步可以开始时，注册检查之间的秒数。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:105
msgid "``LMCACHE_MP_COORDINATOR_RESYNC_MAX_WAIT``"
msgstr "``LMCACHE_MP_COORDINATOR_RESYNC_MAX_WAIT``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:106
msgid "``60``"
msgstr "``60``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:107
msgid ""
"Maximum seconds startup resync waits for an MP server before giving up. "
"The coordinator keeps running with empty trackers until normal usage "
"events fill them in."
msgstr "最大秒数启动重新同步等待 MP 服务器在放弃之前。协调器保持运行，使用空的跟踪器，直到正常使用事件填充它们。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:110
msgid "``LMCACHE_MP_COORDINATOR_RESYNC_PAGE_SIZE``"
msgstr "``LMCACHE_MP_COORDINATOR_RESYNC_PAGE_SIZE``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:111
msgid "``1000``"
msgstr "``1000``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:112
msgid ""
"``page_size`` forwarded to the MP server's ``GET /cache/objects`` during "
"resync. Larger values reduce RTT count; the server clamps to its own "
"ceiling."
msgstr ""
"``page_size`` 在重新同步期间转发到 MP 服务器的 ``GET /cache/objects``。较大的值会减少 RTT "
"计数；服务器会限制在其自身的上限。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:117
msgid "Connecting MP servers"
msgstr "连接 MP 服务器"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:119
msgid ""
"An MP server (``lmcache server``) joins the coordinator when you point it"
" at one with ``--coordinator-url``. It registers on startup, heartbeats "
"while running, and deregisters on shutdown -- all on the server's own "
"event loop. This is opt-in: with no URL set, the server runs exactly as "
"before. Each flag falls back to a matching ``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_*`` "
"environment variable (handy for the Kubernetes downward API); an explicit"
" flag wins over the env var."
msgstr ""
"当您通过 ``--coordinator-url`` 为 MP 服务器（\\ ``lmcache server``\\ "
"）指定协调器地址时，该服务器便会加入协调器。它在启动时注册、运行时持续发送心跳、关闭时注销——所有操作均在服务器自身的事件循环中完成。此功能为可选项：若未设置"
" URL，服务器的行为与之前完全相同。每个标志均可回退到对应的 ``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_*`` 环境变量（在使用 "
"Kubernetes Downward API 时非常便捷）；显式标志优先于环境变量。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:130
msgid "Flag (on the MP server)"
msgstr "标志（在 MP 服务器上）"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:131
msgid "Env fallback"
msgstr "环境回退"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:133
msgid "``--coordinator-url``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-url``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:134
msgid "``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_URL``"
msgstr "``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_URL``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:135
msgid ""
"Coordinator base URL, e.g. ``http://coordinator:9300``. Enables "
"registration when set."
msgstr "协调器基础 URL，例如 ``http://coordinator:9300``\\ 。设置后启用注册。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:137
msgid "``--coordinator-advertise-ip``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-advertise-ip``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:138
msgid "``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_ADVERTISE_IP``"
msgstr "``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_ADVERTISE_IP``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:139
msgid ""
"IP the coordinator should reach this server at (defaults to the server's "
"outbound IP)."
msgstr "协调器应通过此服务器访问的 IP（默认为服务器的外部 IP）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:141
msgid "``--coordinator-heartbeat-interval``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-heartbeat-interval``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:142
msgid "``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL``"
msgstr "``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:143
msgid ""
"Seconds between heartbeats (must be ``> 0``, default ``5``). Keep it well"
" below the coordinator's ``INSTANCE_TIMEOUT``."
msgstr "心跳之间的秒数（必须为 ``> 0``\\ ，默认值为 ``5``\\ ）。保持远低于协调器的 ``INSTANCE_TIMEOUT``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:145
msgid "``--coordinator-l2-event-reporting``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-l2-event-reporting``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:146
msgid "``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_L2_EVENT_REPORTING``"
msgstr "``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_L2_EVENT_REPORTING``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:147
msgid ""
"Enable reporting L2 store/lookup events to the coordinator for fleet-wide"
" usage tracking and quota-based eviction."
msgstr "启用向协调器上报 L2 存储/查找事件，用于全集群使用量跟踪及基于配额的逐出。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:149
msgid "``--coordinator-l2-event-flush-interval``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-l2-event-flush-interval``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:150
msgid "``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_L2_EVENT_FLUSH_INTERVAL``"
msgstr "``LMCACHE_COORDINATOR_L2_EVENT_FLUSH_INTERVAL``"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:151
msgid "Seconds between L2 event batch flushes (must be ``> 0``, default ``1``)."
msgstr "L2 事件批量刷新之间的秒数（必须为 ``> 0``\\ ，默认值为 ``1``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:153
msgid ""
"The server registers under its stable identity (``--instance-id`` / OTel "
"``service.instance.id``); if the flag is not passed, the server mints a "
"random UUID v4 at startup and registers under that."
msgstr ""
"服务器在其稳定身份下注册（\\ ``--instance-id`` / OTel ``service.instance.id``\\ "
"）；如果未传递该标志，服务器将在启动时生成一个随机的 UUID v4 并在该 UUID 下注册。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:157
msgid ""
"Registration is best-effort: if the coordinator is unreachable, the MP "
"server logs a warning, keeps retrying, and continues serving. A malformed"
" heartbeat-interval value is rejected at startup."
msgstr "注册是尽力而为的：如果协调器无法访问，MP 服务器会记录警告，持续重试，并继续提供服务。启动时会拒绝格式错误的心跳间隔值。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:162
