#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:166
msgid ""
"**Fleet membership and health** -- registration and liveness "
"(``/instances``, ``/healthz``)."
msgstr "**车队成员资格和健康** -- 注册和存活 (``/instances``, ``/healthz``)。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:168
msgid ""
"**Quota, usage, and eviction** -- the ``/quota`` group: per-tenant byte "
"budgets, usage accounting, and the usage-event ingest that drives fleet-"
"wide eviction."
msgstr "**配额、使用情况和逐出** -- ``/quota`` 组：每个租户的字节预算、使用情况核算，以及驱动全队逐出的使用事件摄取。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:171
msgid ""
"**Cache control** -- the ``/cache`` group: cache operations dispatched to"
" a named server (warm prefetch, pin/unpin, and delete, with more to "
"come)."
msgstr "**缓存控制** -- ``/cache`` 组：分派给命名服务器的缓存操作（热预取、固定/解固定和删除，更多功能即将推出）。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:174
#, python-brace-format
