"Each endpoint is documented below. Success is ``200`` unless noted, and "
"``{cache_salt}`` uses the ``_default`` sentinel for the empty salt. The "
"wire types live in ``lmcache/v1/mp_coordinator/schemas.py``."
msgstr ""
"每个端点的文档如下。成功状态为 ``200``，除非另有说明，``{cache_salt}`` 使用 ``_default`` "
"哨兵表示空盐。数据类型位于 ``lmcache/v1/mp_coordinator/schemas.py``。"

#: ../../source/mp/coordinator.rst:179
